rmal\">over.</em></h1><p class=\"mt-7 text-lg text-fg/80 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed\">Every face behind these words was a son, a daughter, a parent, a friend. We carry their voices into schools, rallies and capitols so no other family has to lose someone to fentanyl poisoning.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/victims/submit\">Honor your loved one</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/donate\">Donate to the fight</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-24 text-center\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-6\">Words matter · Just say it</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-light leading-tight\">Most victims <span class=\"text-candle\">did not know</span> they were about to consume fentanyl.</h2><p class=\"mt-8 text-lg text-fg/75 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">When someone hides a deadly substance in something another person takes, without their knowledge or intent, it is a <strong class=\"text-fg font-semibold\">poisoning</strong>, not an overdose. There is no safe dose of illicit fentanyl, and no instructions being ignored.</p></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-10\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow mb-3\">The facts</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-light\">Illicit fentanyl, explained</h2></div><a class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-lilac hover:text-fg\" href=\"/resources\">Download fact sheets →</a></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-8 relative overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"block font-display text-5xl font-light text-brand/50 mb-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\">0<!-- -->1</span><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl mb-4\">What is illicit fentanyl?</h3><p class=\"text-fg/75 leading-relaxed\">Illicit fentanyl is not the prescription-grade product used in U.S. medicine. The base molecule is modified to increase potency, or chemical substitutes are added during processing, making it exceedingly potent and unfit for human use.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-8 relative overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"block font-display text-5xl font-light text-brand/50 mb-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\">0<!-- -->2</span><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl mb-4\">Where is it coming from?</h3><p class=\"text-fg/75 leading-relaxed\">China began mass-manufacturing illicit fentanyl products as early as 2013 and remains the number-one global source of illicit fentanyl and its precursor chemicals, working with Mexico&#x27;s drug cartels.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-8 relative overflow-hidden\"><span class=\"block font-display text-5xl font-light text-brand/50 mb-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\">0<!-- -->3</span><h3 class=\"font-display text-2xl mb-4\">How is it harming the public?</h3><p class=\"text-fg/75 leading-relaxed\">Fake pills made to look like Xanax, Adderall, Percocet and Oxycodone have flooded U.S. black markets, and fentanyl now contaminates cocaine, ecstasy, meth, marijuana and more.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-28 grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.3fr] gap-12 items-center\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow mb-3\">Victim banners</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-light leading-tight\">Their faces, impossible to ignore.</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-fg/75 text-lg leading-relaxed\">Our banners carry the faces of the people fentanyl has taken, each one forever the age they were lost. Families bring them to rallies, hearings and vigils, and display them at home.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/victims/banners\">View all banners</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/shop/victim-banner\">Order a banner</a></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-6 bg-brand/20 blur-3xl rounded-full\" aria-hidden=\